# Everything in this repository is read by Linux: bootstrap scripts run on the
# instance, Lambda handlers run in the runtime, workflow steps run on the runner.
# A file committed from Windows with CRLF endings reaches all three with a
# trailing carriage return on every line, and the failure is obscure -- a shell
# reports `$'\r': command not found` on a line that looks correct.
#
# So line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as LF on
# every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
